## 5. API Reference

**Base URL:** `http://127.0.0.1:8000`

All endpoints return JSON. Authentication is via `Authorization: Bearer <token>` header for protected routes.

### Authentication
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| POST | `/auth/register/` | No | Register new user |
| POST | `/auth/login/` | No | Login, get JWT tokens |
| POST | `/auth/token/refresh/` | No | Refresh access token |
| POST | `/auth/logout/` | Yes | Blacklist refresh token |
| POST | `/auth/password-reset/` | No | Request password reset email |
| POST | `/auth/password-reset/confirm/` | No | Confirm password reset |

### Vessels
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | `/vessels/` | No | List vessels (supports `?name=&type=&flag=&cargo_type=`) |
| GET | `/vessels/<id>/` | No | Vessel detail |
| PATCH | `/vessels/<id>/update-position/` | No | Update vessel position (AIS simulator uses this) |
| GET | `/vessels/<id>/events/` | No | Vessel event history |
| POST | `/vessels/<id>/subscribe/` | Yes | Subscribe to vessel |
| DELETE | `/vessels/<id>/unsubscribe/` | Yes | Unsubscribe from vessel |
| GET | `/subscriptions/` | Yes | List user's subscriptions |

### Ports
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | `/ports/` | No | All ports |
| GET | `/ports/<id>/` | No | Single port |
| GET | `/ports/congestion/` | No | Ports sorted by congestion score |
| GET | `/ports/analytics/` | No | Analytics aggregate (charts data) |

### Voyages & Safety
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | `/voyages/` | No | All voyages |
| GET | `/voyages/<id>/replay/` | No | Voyage waypoints for replay |
| GET | `/safety-events/` | No | Active safety zones |
| GET | `/notifications/` | Yes | User notifications |

